<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">THE TASTY TOP LIST</view><view class="title">好味道<text class="accent">，</text>有口皆碑</view><view class="subtitle">每一份真实评价，都让美味被看见</view><view class="pill">🏆 探店口碑榜 · 评分实时更新</view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">人气美食 TOP {{foods.length}}</text><text class="muted">综合评分排序</text></view><view wx:for="{{foods}}" wx:key="id" class="rank-card {{index<3?'top':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openFood"><view class="rank">{{item.medal || item.rank}}</view><image class="rank-image" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="rank-info"><view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.category}}</view><view class="muted">¥{{item.price}}/人 · {{item.reviewCount}} 条评价</view></view><view class="rank-score"><text>★</text>{{item.score}}</view></view><view class="footer-note">榜单根据本机全部评价自动计算</view></view>
